            <h4 style="color: #002147; border-bottom: 2px solid #004080; padding-bottom: 5px; font-size:20px; font-weight:600;">About Dr. Alok Sanyal </h4>
            <p style="font-size:16px; font-family:Arial; line-height:30px; text-align:justify; line-height:30px;color:black;">
                Alok Sanyal is working as an Assistant Professor in the Department of Mechanical Engineering at Bharat Ratna Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Rajkiya Engineering College, Pratapgarh. Currently, he is serving as the Officer Incharge of library and Officer Incharge of Training and Placement at Bharat Ratna Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Rajkiya Engineering College, Pratapgarh. His research interest includes, Robotics, Mechatronics and Production. He is pursuing his Ph.D. from Motilal Nehru National Institute of Technology Allahabad, Prayagraj. Before joining at Bharat Ratna Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Rajkiya Engineering College, Pratapgarh, he has worked as Lecturer in the Department of Power Plant at Institute of Engineering and Rural Technology, Prayagraj, U.P. for two years. He has completed his M. Tech in Production Engineering from Motilal Nehru National Institute of Technology Allahabad, Prayagraj. He has published several research papers in reputed International/national journals and conferences.
            </p>


